DOAO6SJc8AAAABLk-wVw","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T16:17:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T16:17:28Z","body":"In addons, frequently folks will have a tool script that creates instances of non-tool scripts, and because they are created explicitly they aren't created as placeholder instances, so they run in the editor like tool scripts. Will this break connecting signals on those instances? If so, I don't think this compat breakage would be OK\r\n\r\nIf we could check that the script instance is not a placeholder (rather than checking if the script is a tool), that would be ideal, however, I'm not sure if we have a good way to do that","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5071941719/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5072392622","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101157#issuecomment-5072392622","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101157","id":5072392622,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLlaRrg","user":{"login":"LanzaSchneider","id":24624901,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjI0OTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24624901?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/LanzaSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T17:03:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T17:03:45Z","body":"@dsnopek Thank you for the information. Perhaps we can change it like this?\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n\t\tObject *target = callable.get_object();\r\n\r\n#ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED\r\n\t\tif (target && flags & CONNECT_PERSIST && Engine::get_singleton()->is_editor_hint()) {\r\n\t\t\tScriptInstance *target_script_instance = target->get_script_instance();\r\n\t\t\tif (target_script_instance && target_script_instance->is_placeholder()) {\r\n\t\t\t\t// Trying to call not-tool method in editor, just ignore it.\r\n\t\t\t\tcontinue;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n#endif\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5072392622/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]